From: heiby_u@falkor.chi.il.us (Ron Heiby)
Subject: 3.2G to 4.0D Benchmark Comparison
Date: 1998/06/18
Message-ID: <3589219f.4921490@149.174.211.108>
X-Deja-AN: 363917597
