General sendmail configuration is to send-mail directly to receiving
host. When your WAN is down, not only do you have no route to the host
in question, but also DNS queries to the outside are unresolvable.

Try to post your question to comp.mail.sendmail and ask them how to make
sendmail detect WAN connection down. Personally, I haven't seen such an
option. Maybe some kind of queue manipulation.

Nix.




