Try:

boot in single user

mount root in read/write mode:

mount -u /
or
mount -u -t advfs /dev/rz1a   /

recreate root_domain and usr_domain:

cd /etc/fdmns
mkdir root_domain
cd root_domain
ln -s /dev/rz1a
cd ..
mkdir usr_domain
cd usr_domain
ln -s /dev/rz1g


check /etc/fstab and reboot in multiuser mode


