You must add at the bottom of the .profile:

 exec passwd

and make the user shell : /bin/ksh, for example

With this changes, the user have the ability to make a telnet to your
server, but he/she only can change his/her password.

The ability to move around in ftp can be restricted changing the permission
of the files and directories that you don't want the users can access.

