Note that Cdparanoia is currently Linux only; this is not because porting isn't a
priority, just that the interface modules for other platforms aren't there
yet.  Linux was the hardest platform to write for (due to a buggy, nay wacky,
generic scsi driver) so I did it first.

If you're thinking of using cdparanoia alpha 6 (the current release) as example 
source code for talking to Linux, there are some good tricks.  There will be even
more such good tricks in alpha 7 (upcoming :-)

Monty



