I've inherited a couple of Digital servers, which have been installed by
DEC, so noone here knows the configuration.

Can some kind soul give me a hint on good commands to quickly get a feel
for the disk setup,  I mean I'd like to know which disks there are on
the system, which one are used by advfs and lsm and how.

I find lots of commands, but what I'd like is a few hints from you
experienced DNIX managers, how would you go about it when you sit down
at a new system and quickly wants to "size it up".

